---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import {posts} from '../lib/content.js';
---
<Base home>
<section class="hero wrap">
<p class="eyebrow">Software development and product consulting</p>
<h1>Good software starts with <span>deciding what matters.</span></h1>
<div class="hero-bottom"><div><p class="intro">Optimum Tech helps businesses decide what to build, develop the software, and put it to work.</p><p class="support">We combine product thinking with hands-on engineering, drawing on experience building our own products and delivering client projects.</p><a class="button" href="mailto:almir@optimum.ba">Tell us what you’re building <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="brand-signature" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/brand/optimum-symbol-cobalt.svg" width="272" height="272" alt="" /></div></div>
</section>
<section class="work-section" id="work"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">What we’re working on</p><h2>Product thinking.<br />Put into practice.</h2></div>
<div class="work-grid"><div class="work-intro"><p>Bring us in to shape a product, build or improve an application, or help your team adopt and integrate our products.</p><p class="support">Our current work explores AI-assisted software development, alongside the Elixir tools and engineering experience we continue to build on.</p></div><div class="work-list"><a class="work-item featured" href="https://kogen.dev/"><div class="item-top"><h3>Kogen</h3><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><p class="kogen-line">Shape the feature. Leave the build to Kogen.</p><p>Our work on turning product decisions into software through AI-assisted implementation, checks, and independent review.</p><span class="text-link">Explore Kogen</span></a><a class="work-item" href="https://phx.tools/"><div class="item-top"><h3>phx.tools</h3><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><p>A development environment for Elixir and Phoenix.</p></a><a class="work-item" href="https://whyelixir.dev/"><div class="item-top"><h3>Why Elixir?</h3><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><p>An introduction to the language behind much of our work.</p></a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="journal wrap" id="blog-section"><div class="journal-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">From the blog</p><h2>Lessons from the work.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/blog/">All articles <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><p class="archive-note">Writing on Elixir, delivery, and design from the Optimum BH years.</p><div class="article-list">{posts.slice(0,3).map(post => <a class="article-row" href={`/blog/${post.slug}/`}><time datetime={post.date.toISOString()}>{post.date.toLocaleDateString('en-GB',{day:'numeric',month:'short',year:'numeric',timeZone:'UTC'})}</time><div><h3>{post.title}</h3><p>{post.author}</p></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>)}</div></section>
<section class="contact wrap" id="contact"><p class="eyebrow">Let’s talk</p><h2>What are you building?</h2><p>Tell us where you are, what you’re trying to achieve, and where you could use a hand.</p><a href="mailto:almir@optimum.ba">almir@optimum.ba <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
</Base>
